,{"id":"ccdd_CHANGELOG.md#140","metadata":{"content":"del gate.","okf_concept":"ccdd_CHANGELOG.md","okf_type":"Documentation","title":"CCDD — Changelog"}},{"id":"ccdd_CHANGELOG.md#141","metadata":{"content":"del gate.","okf_concept":"ccdd_CHANGELOG.md","okf_type":"Documentation","title":"CCDD — Changelog"}},{"id":"ccdd_CHANGELOG.md#142","metadata":{"content":"el gate.","okf_concept":"ccdd_CHANGELOG.md","okf_type":"Documentation","title":"CCDD — Changelog"}},{"id":"ccdd_CHANGELOG.md#143","metadata":{"content":"l gate.","okf_concept":"ccdd_CHANGELOG.md","okf_type":"Documentation","title":"CCDD — Changelog"}},{"id":"ccdd_CHANGELOG.md#144","metadata":{"content":"gate.","okf_concept":"ccdd_CHANGELOG.md","okf_type":"Documentation","title":"CCDD — Changelog"}},{"id":"ccdd_CHANGELOG.md#145","metadata":{"content":"gate.","okf_concept":"ccdd_CHANGELOG.md","okf_type":"Documentation","title":"CCDD — Changelog"}},{"id":"ccdd_CHANGELOG.md#146","metadata":{"content":"ate.","okf_concept":"ccdd_CHANGELOG.md","okf_type":"Documentation","title":"CCDD — Changelog"}},{"id":"ccdd_CHANGELOG.md#147","metadata":{"content":"te.","okf_concept":"ccdd_CHANGELOG.md","okf_type":"Documentation","title":"CCDD — Changelog"}},{"id":"ccdd_CHANGELOG.md#148","metadata":{"content":"e.","okf_concept":"ccdd_CHANGELOG.md","okf_type":"Documentation","title":"CCDD — Changelog"}},{"id":"ccdd_CHANGELOG.md#149","metadata":{"content":".","okf_concept":"ccdd_CHANGELOG.md","okf_type":"Documentation","title":"CCDD — Changelog"}},{"id":"ccdd_CHANGELOG.md#15","metadata":{"content":"stórico).\n\n---\n\n## v0.3 — Draft","okf_concept":"ccdd_CHANGELOG.md","okf_type":"Documentation","title":"CCDD — Changelog"}},{"id":"ccdd_CHANGELOG.md#150","metadata":{"content":"### Generación de contratos — `ccdd init` (determinista)\nHasta ahora el contrato se redactaba 100% a mano (la barrera de entrada). `init` genera un contrato\nbase con **buenas prácticas por defecto** (críticos firmados con piso, guardrail anti-secretos,\nprioridades sanas) que lintea limpio (0 advertencias) y ensambla de una.\n- **Decisión de diseño:** la generación es ella misma híbrida — estructura **determinista** (plantilla)\n  + la línea base de **políticas vetada y determinista** (NO generada por un LLM, porque los modelos\n  confabulan con las políticas) + firma humana. Lo específico del dominio se agrega encima.\n- Plantillas: `chat` (default) y `tool-agent` (agrega un slot `tool_specs`).\n- Tests: +3 (44 → 47).","okf_concept":"ccdd_CHANGELOG.md","okf_type":"Documentation","title":"CCDD — Changelog"}},{"id":"ccdd_CHANGELOG.md#151","metadata":{"content":"a un slot `tool_specs`).\n- Tests: +3 (44 → 47). Un test cazó un bug del template `tool-agent` (llaves mal escapadas).","okf_concept":"ccdd_CHANGELOG.md","okf_type":"Documentation","title":"CCDD — Changelog"}},{"id":"ccdd_CHANGELOG.md#152","metadata":{"content":"el template `tool-agent` (llaves mal escapadas).","okf_concept":"ccdd_CHANGELOG.md","okf_type":"Documentation","title":"CCDD — Changelog"}},{"id":"ccdd_CHANGELOG.md#153","metadata":{"content":"l template `tool-agent` (llaves mal escapadas).","okf_concept":"ccdd_CHANGELOG.md","okf_type":"Documentation","title":"CCDD — Changelog"}},{"id":"ccdd_CHANGELOG.md#154","metadata":{"content":"template `tool-agent` (llaves mal escapadas).","okf_concept":"ccdd_CHANGELOG.md","okf_type":"Documentation","title":"CCDD — Changelog"}},{"id":"ccdd_CHANGELOG.md#155","metadata":{"content":"template `tool-agent` (llaves mal escapadas).","okf_concept":"ccdd_CHANGELOG.md","okf_type":"Documentation","title":"CCDD — Changelog"}},{"id":"ccdd_CHANGELOG.md#156","metadata":{"content":"emplate `tool-agent` (llaves mal escapadas).","okf_concept":"ccdd_CHANGELOG.md","okf_type":"Documentation","title":"CCDD — Changelog"}},{"id":"ccdd_CHANGELOG.md#157","metadata":{"content":"mplate `tool-agent` (llaves mal escapadas).","okf_concept":"ccdd_CHANGELOG.md","okf_type":"Documentation","title":"CCDD — Changelog"}},{"id":"ccdd_CHANGELOG.md#158","metada